<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <div class="page"><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Privacy</p><h1>Privacy</h1></div></div><div class="empty"><p>The public Library is static-first and uses no behavioral analytics in the v1 architecture. Reading state, saved works, offline state, and annotations are designed to remain in the browser. The optional Ask Library service is separate from the public application and must be owner-authenticated before provider work occurs.</p></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
